        {
          "sid": "animals-t1-s05",
          "c": "兔仔食蔬菜。",
          "j": "tou3 zai2 sik6 so1 coi3.",
          "e": "Rabbits eat vegetables.",
          "note": "兔仔 (tou3 zai2) \"rabbit\" — the 仔 (zai2) \"little\" suffix is hugely productive, attaching to animals and small things (薯仔 syu4 zai2 \"potato\", 狗仔 gau2 zai2 \"puppy\", 細路仔 sai3 lou6 zai2 \"little kid\").",
          "bd": [
